fact WorkItem(id: "WI-137", description: some(value: "Vec3 vector operations in anthill stdlib (prerequisite for decomposing step_distance_lemma into geometric axioms). Today Vec3 in anthill.geometry is a plain entity (x, y, z fields) with no arithmetic —  for two Vec3 values doesn't typecheck. Add a VectorSpace[V, Scalar] spec in anthill.algebra (or anthill.geometry) with operations add / sub / scale / zero, plus a satisfaction fact for Vec3 with Float scalar. Initial scope: just the operations + their algebraic-law rules (associativity, commutativity, additive identity, additive inverse). Norm and inner product follow in a separate WI. Acceptance: cargo-test passes; new test verifies  for two Vec3 values resolves through the spec;  clean."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-28T16:07:14Z"))
